2026-09-25 03:36:04,423 [INFO]       builds TODAY's 5m/15m/1h bars from 1-MINUTE intraday instead of asking the
2026-09-25 03:36:04,423 [INFO]       intraday endpoint for them directly, because that endpoint only emits a
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       forming bar 0-6 min late and the engines read iloc[-2] assuming iloc[-1]
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       is the forming bar. Deliberately NOT raising the 16-min stale guard —
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       that would hide stale indicators instead of surfacing them.
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       52/52 instrument-day-interval combos reproduce Upstox's own O/H/L/C/vol/OI
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       EXACTLY. See upstox_kite_shim.py CHANGE_HISTORY.  [FIX]
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO] 
