2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       why a trade was not taken". Every EXP12 gate now increments a counter
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       (_exp12_block) and records the closest miss (_exp12_near);
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       _exp12_eod_report() sends one consolidated per-engine message. On the
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       08-27 book this renders as "EXP2: no trade — blocked by spot too far from
2026-09-25 03:36:04,424 [INFO]       strike x148 ... closest: 77400CE prem 12.30 OK but dist -318", which is
